WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.878 --> 00:00:05.088
What's wrong, Miyuki?

00:00:07.048 --> 00:00:08.967
Father! It's snowing!

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.053
Why don't you come inside? It's cold.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.930
No! I want to watch.

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:17.225
She's just like you.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:30.071
We can't have my treasure freeze.

00:00:36.411 --> 00:00:37.662
Snow, huh?

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:41.958
This is probably the last time
it'll snow this year.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:53.803
I beg you!

00:00:54.596 --> 00:00:56.514
Tell me, Unmo!

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.433
Am I...

00:01:00.143 --> 00:01:02.687
Am I human?! Or a Kabane?!

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:09.944
Kabane.

00:01:10.487 --> 00:01:11.529
Walking corpses.

00:01:12.155 --> 00:01:13.281
Raised from the dead.

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:16.618
Hinomoto is under threat from the Kabane.

00:01:17.619 --> 00:01:21.289
The Kabane have taken control
of almost the entire country.

